{"ID":"20240118145010-dupu9ko","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118145010-dupu9ko","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118145010-dupu9ko\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118145010-z8e0l2s\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122162655-fl2zeig\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122162655-fl2zeig\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:244,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:244\u0026#125;","title":"339蜈蚣","type":"doc","updated":"20240204150321"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118145010-z8e0l2s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118145010-z8e0l2s","updated":"20240122162634"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味辛，温，有毒。治鬼疰，虫毒，啖诸蛇、虫、鱼毒，杀鬼物老精，温疟，去三虫。生川谷。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122162636-0ejnl7e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162636-0ejnl7e"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】处处有之，赤足者良。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122162638-50r6i5z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162638-50r6i5z"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味辛，性温，有毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122162639-d5xn2b0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162639-d5xn2b0"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】蜈蚣为驱风散结要药，主小儿惊痫，风搐脐风，治寒热积聚，堕胎，去恶血，制蛇毒。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122162640-2nhlcaw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162640-2nhlcaw"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】疗心腹寒热积聚，堕胎，去恶血。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122162642-y8gfn9i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162642-y8gfn9i"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【日华】治癥瘕。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122162643-yj0676t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162643-yj0676t"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通一至二钱。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122162644-xaxj8tq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162644-xaxj8tq"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】蜈蚣有毒，必风气暴烈，药病相当，乃可设，或过剂，以蚯蚓桑皮解之，畏蛞蝓，被蜈蚣螫伤，捣蛞蝓涂之即止痛。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122162634-qizwve7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162634-qizwve7"}},{"ID":"20240122162645-fgkwfk6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162645-fgkwfk6","updated":"20240122162651"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蜈蚣，诸位看这个蜈蚣长的样子，这么大一只，蜈蚣，已经干了没有关系。那蜈蚣呢列入《神农本草经》，在《神农本草经》里面。"}]},{"ID":"20240122162655-fl2zeig","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162655-fl2zeig","updated":"20240204150321"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"过去我们使用在肿瘤硬块的时候会用蜈蚣，因为蜈蚣很凶啊，它咬进去的力量很强，所以"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"淋巴癌，淋巴肿块，肝癌肿块，都会使用到蜈蚣，但是诸位记得，动物性的药它本身攻坚的力量很强，但同时会伤血，一定会伤到。所以说你要加一些补血的药，混合在一起，攻补、补泻兼顾"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，不要老是在那边攻。诸位看这个蜈蚣味辛，辛辣的，性温，有毒，它是祛风散结的要药，小儿孩子的惊痫，这个癫痫我们会使用到，堕胎也可以用到，它能够控制治蛇毒也可以。那【日华】的症瘕之症就是我们讲的硬块，剂量一般来说一钱两钱就够了，不会用到很多。"}]}]}